---
import ServicePage from '../layouts/ServicePage.astro';
---

<ServicePage
  slug="accounts-preparation"
  title="Accounts preparation"
  eyebrow="Service 02"
  lead="Annual, monthly or quarterly accounts for sole traders, partnerships and limited companies."
  description="Annual, monthly and quarterly accounts preparation for sole traders, partnerships and limited companies in Northern Ireland."
  asideTitle="Hand over your accounts"
  emailSubject="Accounts preparation"
>
  <section class="prose" aria-labelledby="annual-heading">
    <h2 id="annual-heading" class="h3">Annual accounts</h2>
    <p>
      We prepare annual accounts for self-employed individuals (sole traders), partnerships and limited companies.
      Whether you already have a full bookkeeping software service in place, or you simply have a shoebox full of
      receipts, our team can save you from the daunting task of preparing and filing your annual accounts.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="prose" aria-labelledby="monthly-heading">
    <h2 id="monthly-heading" class="h3">Monthly or quarterly accounts</h2>
    <p>
      Good planning and monitoring is essential for business growth. With our accountants on your side, your monthly
      or quarterly accounts can be prepared so you can quickly identify trends and keep an eye on expenses and payroll.
    </p>
    <p>
      It all helps you forecast and plan your strategy, so you can focus on running and growing your business, with
      no nasty shocks at the end of the year.
    </p>
    <ul class="chips" aria-label="Used for">
      <li class="chip">Budgeting</li>
      <li class="chip">Forecasts</li>
      <li class="chip">Business planning</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</ServicePage>
